        "language": "english",
        "review": "I did overall like the game, but I have a couple issues with it.\n\nWhat I liked: \n- Has a strong \"Fears to Fathom\" vibe, but does it's own thing\n- Some cool cosmic/liminal horror\n- Truly creepy parts, with a scary entity\n\nWhat I hated:\n- Seems to end very abruptly\n- In one part, you need to be able to listen to a voice recording to move on, and it is nearly impossible to understand what they're saying\n- Not really a lot of options for settings, plus you can't access them in game \n- Confusing story. It just may have been me, but I felt like there were a few missing pieces to the puzzle (maybe that was on purpose)\n\nOverall would recommend. Better than a lot of horror games I've recently played",
